<section class="gw-cov"><div class="gw-w"><h1 class="gw-mast" id="mast">Garbway</h1></div><div class="gw-w gw-cov-g"><div class="gw-cl gw-cl-l"><p class="rv"><b>The proportion issue</b>Why the line matters more than the label</p><p class="rv"><b>Colour, decoded</b>A wheel you can actually use</p></div><figure class="gw-cov-i"><img data-px=".08" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1652590480678-ad2baa51f76c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1200&q=75" alt="a woman in a teal coat and sunglasses walking down a street" width="900" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Cover: the teal coat, worn with ease</figcaption></figure><div class="gw-cl gw-cl-r"><p class="rv"><b>12 looks</b>From the street, explained</p><p class="rv"><b>Try it</b>The silhouette lab, inside</p><svg class="gw-bar" viewBox="0 0 120 50" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="0" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="4" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="7" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="12" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="19" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="22" y="0" width="4" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="28" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="31" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="35" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="40" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="43" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="47" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="50" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="55" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="58" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="62" y="0" width="4" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="68" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="71" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="75" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="78" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="83" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="87" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="90" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="94" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="99" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="102" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="106" y="0" width="1" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="109" y="0" width="3" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="114" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="118" y="0" width="2" height="40" fill="currentColor"/><text x="60" y="49" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="currentColor">0 19 2026 0419</text></svg></div></div></section>

<div class="gw-mq mq" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Silhouette</span><span>Proportion</span><span>Colour</span><span>Texture</span><span>Line</span><span>Volume</span><span>Silhouette</span><span>Proportion</span><span>Colour</span><span>Texture</span><span>Line</span><span>Volume</span></div></div>

<section class="gw-s gw-ed"><div class="gw-w gw-ed-g"><p class="gw-ey">Editor&rsquo;s letter</p><p class="gw-big rv">Style is not a list of things to buy. It is a handful of ideas about <mark>shape, balance and colour</mark>, and once you can see them, every wardrobe gets easier.</p><div class="gw-ed-n stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="3">3</b><span>ideas behind every good outfit</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="12">12</b><span>colours on a working wheel</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="gw-sps"><div class="gw-w"><div class="gw-sp"><figure class="gw-sp-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596993100471-c3905dafa78e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=980&q=75" alt="a man in a black and yellow jacket wearing sunglasses" width="760" height="980" loading="lazy"></figure><div class="gw-sp-t"><span class="gw-sp-n">01</span><h3 class="rv">Contrast</h3><p class="rv">One bold piece, everything else quiet. A single loud colour reads as confidence; three read as noise.</p></div></div><div class="gw-sp gw-sp-r"><figure class="gw-sp-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547069553-12f23c839aaa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=980&q=75" alt="a woman wearing a bright green sweater" width="760" height="980" loading="lazy"></figure><div class="gw-sp-t"><span class="gw-sp-n">02</span><h3 class="rv">Volume</h3><p class="rv">Big on top, slim below, or the reverse. Give volume to one half of the body and let the other half anchor it.</p></div></div><div class="gw-sp"><figure class="gw-sp-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1768696083080-15d4218ce844?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=980&q=75" alt="a young woman in a red dress against a red wall" width="760" height="980" loading="lazy"></figure><div class="gw-sp-t"><span class="gw-sp-n">03</span><h3 class="rv">Tonal</h3><p class="rv">Dress head to toe in one colour family and let texture do the talking. It lengthens the line instantly.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="gw-s gw-lab" id="lab"><div class="gw-w gw-lab-g"><div><p class="gw-ey">Interactive</p><h2 class="rv">The silhouette lab</h2><p class="gw-p">Choose a top and a bottom. The figure changes, and we tell you how the proportions read.</p><fieldset class="gw-fs"><legend>Top</legend><div class="gw-chips"><label><input type="radio" name="tp" value="0" checked><span>Tucked</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="tp" value="1"><span>Cropped</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="tp" value="2"><span>Oversized</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="tp" value="3"><span>Long line</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="gw-fs"><legend>Bottom</legend><div class="gw-chips"><label><input type="radio" name="bt" value="0" checked><span>Wide leg</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bt" value="1"><span>Slim</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="bt" value="2"><span>Midi skirt</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="gw-lab-o" id="lab-o" aria-live="polite"></div></div><div class="gw-lab-v"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 420" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="120" cy="40" r="22" class="sk"/><rect x="112" y="60" width="16" height="12" class="sk"/><path id="lb-b" class="pb"/><path id="lb-t" class="pt"/><line x1="20" y1="140" x2="220" y2="140" class="g3" id="lb-g1"/><line x1="20" y1="280" x2="220" y2="280" class="g3"/></svg><p class="gw-small">Dotted lines mark thirds of the body. A waistline near a third usually looks balanced.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="gw-s gw-stw"><div class="gw-w gw-stw-h"><h2 class="rv">From the street</h2><p class="gw-hint">Drag &rarr;</p></div><div class="hs gw-hs"><div class="gw-st"><div class="gw-st-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624353656309-8be1a6c457be?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=640&q=75" alt="a woman in an orange and white pyjama-style set walking" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>01</span>Soft tailoring</p></div><div class="gw-st"><div class="gw-st-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584216338898-f34d78201414?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=640&q=75" alt="a woman in a grey coat on the street" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>02</span>The long coat</p></div><div class="gw-st"><div class="gw-st-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1651828854976-4fa163b636ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=640&q=75" alt="a person wearing an orange outfit" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>03</span>Colour block</p></div><div class="gw-st"><div class="gw-st-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1715541448446-3369e1cc0ee9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=640&q=75" alt="a woman in a black top and black trousers" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>04</span>All black</p></div><div class="gw-st"><div class="gw-st-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1715559522419-db7face19c1c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=480&h=640&q=75" alt="two women standing side by side in neutral outfits" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"></div><p><span>05</span>Neutrals</p></div></div></section>

<section class="gw-s gw-cw" id="wheel"><div class="gw-w gw-cw-g"><div class="gw-cw-v"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 320" id="cw" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div><div><p class="gw-ey">Colour wheel</p><h2 class="rv">Pick a colour, get a palette</h2><p class="gw-p">Choose a base colour, then a scheme. The wheel shows the partners, and the swatches show how to wear them.</p><div class="gw-chips" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Scheme"><label><input type="radio" name="sc" value="c" checked><span>Complementary</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="sc" value="a"><span>Analogous</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="sc" value="t"><span>Triadic</span></label></div><div class="gw-sw" id="cw-sw"></div><p id="cw-o" class="gw-cw-o" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section>

